Z||000003||Earne||03-25-2000||10:30 AM||||fieroshop,<P>"Born in 1984, died in 1988...", my azz.  I take some offense at the assumption that the Fiero is dead.  Orphaned, abandoned, even criminal child neglect on the part of GM, but "dead"?  No friggin' way.  Maybe the club could rethink the opening line in the Fiero History section.  Anyone else here think their Fiero is dead?  I realize the line refers to the end of production, I just don't like the analogy.<P>Other than that, nice work, looks good.<P>Earne (ToyMaker)||||reg||1
